            freezeTreeBorrowsOnReadAtProj_eq_self_of_treeField_prefix m.borrows m.borrows [.field subIdx subTy] hExcl m.activeProtectors⟩
        · nomatch hMove
  | move_deref_field hGetPtr hLookVal hRead =>
