  ⟨h.meta_of_length.evalRvalue_ptrMetadata hOp, h⟩

/-- **`UnsizedSliceDstAt.evalOperand_field0`**: projecting `.field 0` (data
pointer of a decomposed 2-field `(data, meta)` aggregate local `loc`) of an
